<rdf:RDF
    xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
    xmlns:swrlb="http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrlb#"
    xmlns:e="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#"
    xmlns:enterprise="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#"
    xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
    xmlns:process="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#"
    xmlns:c="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#"
    xmlns:paint="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#"
    xmlns:f="http://w3id.org/protys/fixture#"
    xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#"
    xmlns:swrl="http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#"
    xmlns:t="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#"
    xmlns:product="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#"
    xmlns:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#"
    xmlns:a="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment#"
    xmlns:i="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#"
    xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#">
  <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Capa de Alineamiento de PROTYS(KB) (Cap. 3, §3.3.3.5-3.3.3.6): los siete axiomas owl:equivalentClass del Listado 3.3 y las 26 reglas de alineamiento R01-R26 (Anexo C) en el fragmento DL-safe de SWRL. R03, R12 y R23 siguen la redacción canónica del Listado 3.4. R07, R16, R19 y R26 están reformuladas como patrones de validación SPARQL ASK (ver ontologies/alignment-queries.sparql) porque requieren negación (FILTER NOT EXISTS), no expresable en SWRL.</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:versionInfo>2.0</owl:versionInfo>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">PROTYS(KB) - Capa de Alineamiento</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Ontology>
  <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core">
    <owl:versionInfo>2.0</owl:versionInfo>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Nivel Principal de la red de ontologías PROTYS(KB) (Cap. 3, §3.3.1, Fig. 3.6).
Por decisión arquitectónica contiene únicamente los cuatro conceptos fundamentales de la industria
manufacturera según Zhao et al. (1999), Lin y Harding (2007), Chungoora et al. (2013) y Usman et al. (2013):
Process, Product, Resource y Enterprise, junto con las relaciones producedBy, usedBy, isHeldBy e involve.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">PROTYS(KB) - Core Concepts Module</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">PROTYS(KB) - Módulo Principal (CoreConcepts)</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Ontology>
  <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040">
    <owl:versionInfo>2.0</owl:versionInfo>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Formalización OWL 2 DL del estándar ISO 14040 (Análisis de Ciclo de Vida), Nivel de Estándares de PROTYS(KB). Corresponde al Listado 3.1 del Capítulo 3 (15 clases); validado con HermiT 1.4.3 y Pellet 2.4.0 sin contradicciones. Namespace canónico http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">PROTYS(KB) - Módulo ISO 14040 (Life Cycle Assessment)</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Ontology>
  <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource">
    <owl:versionInfo>2.0</owl:versionInfo>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Módulo del Nivel de Refinamiento que profundiza el concepto Resource del Nivel Principal (Cap. 3, §3.3.2, Figs. 3.9 a 3.12). Según ISO 10303-49 un Resource se define por sus comportamientos (Behaviour) y capacidades (Capability); integra Tool, Equip y Device (ISO 15531, ISO 18629), la especialización de Material (ISO 10303-232, ISO 10303-227, ISO 10303-1082), los recursos humanos (Person, Role) y los recursos digitales (File).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">PROTYS(KB) - Módulo de Recurso (ResourceMod)</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Ontology>
  <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process">
    <owl:versionInfo>2.0</owl:versionInfo>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Módulo del Nivel de Refinamiento que profundiza el concepto Process del Nivel Principal (Cap. 3, §3.3.2, Fig. 3.7). Categorías derivadas de ISO 8000, ISO 10303, ISO 13584, ISO 15531, ISO 15926 e ISO 18629. Los recursos requeridos por una Process_Activity (Process_Material) se definen en el Módulo de Recursos (Fig. 3.10) y se referencian sin redefinirse.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">PROTYS(KB) - Módulo de Proceso (ProcessMod)</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Ontology>
  <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise">
    <owl:versionInfo>2.0</owl:versionInfo>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Módulo del Nivel de Refinamiento que profundiza el concepto Enterprise del Nivel Principal (Cap. 3, §3.3.2, Fig. 3.13), según el modelo de manufactura jerárquico de cuatro niveles de Zhao et al. (1999): Station - Cell - Shop - Factory - Enterprise, más el concepto Location.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">PROTYS(KB) - Módulo de Empresa (EnterpriseMod)</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Ontology>
  <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product">
    <owl:versionInfo>2.0</owl:versionInfo>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Módulo del Nivel de Refinamiento que profundiza el concepto Product del Nivel Principal (Cap. 3, §3.3.2, Fig. 3.8). Basado en ISO 10303-1, ISO 10303-41, ISO 10303-214 e ISO 10303-239. Production_Item es la abstracción que encapsula las propiedades esenciales de Product (Bruno, 2015) y se especializa en Product y Production_Component.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">PROTYS(KB) - Módulo de Producto (ProductMod)</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Ontology>
  <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research">
    <owl:versionInfo>2.0.0</owl:versionInfo>
  </owl:Ontology>
  <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531">
    <owl:versionInfo>2.0</owl:versionInfo>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Formalización OWL 2 DL del estándar ISO 15531 MANDATE (Industrial Manufacturing Management Data), Nivel de Estándares de PROTYS(KB). Corresponde al Listado 3.2 del Capítulo 3 (18 clases); validado con HermiT 1.4.3 y Pellet 2.4.0 sin contradicciones. Namespace canónico http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">PROTYS(KB) - Módulo ISO 15531 (MANDATE)</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Ontology>
  <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext">
    <owl:versionInfo>1.0</owl:versionInfo>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Ontología derivada que encapsula las especializaciones del caso de estudio de fabricación de pinturas (Cap. 4, §4.4.1: "las extensiones quedan encapsuladas como ontología derivada"). Cada clase del caso se declara como subclase de las clases conceptuales de PROTYS(KB) (Cap. 3, §3.3.1-3.3.2), sin modificar los módulos base. Incluye además las propiedades de datos operativas del caso.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">PROTYS(KB) - Extensión del caso de estudio (fabricación de pinturas)</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Ontology>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Raw_Material">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Material"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Materia prima de entrada a las actividades productivas (Fig. 3.10).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Raw_Material</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ProductFlow">
    <owl:equivalentClass>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Product"/>
    </owl:equivalentClass>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Flujo de producto</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#WorkOrder">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger"
        >1</owl:minCardinality>
        <owl:onProperty>
          <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#executedBy"/>
        </owl:onProperty>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Orden de trabajo</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Concept">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Product_Information"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Característica funcional: noción o idea asociada al producto, como su función prevista o su papel en un sistema mayor (p. ej., "pieza de repuesto").</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Concept</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingProcess">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Proceso de manufactura</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Process_Plant">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Instalación física donde ocurre la transformación; en ella se ejecuta el Process_Plan.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Process_Plant</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ResourceState">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Estado de recurso</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#Cell">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:someValuesFrom>
          <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#Shop"/>
        </owl:someValuesFrom>
        <owl:onProperty>
          <owl:TransitiveProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#isPartOf"/>
        </owl:onProperty>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Agrupación lógica de estaciones que realizan operaciones relacionadas dentro del flujo de producción.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Cell</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Organization">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Enterprise"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Organización empresarial (mapeada desde AD_Org de ADempiere / res.company de Odoo). Subclase de core:Enterprise.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Organization</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Thing">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Generalización de Production_Item: distintos estándares (ISO 10303, ISO 15531, ISO 15926) describen Product como una cosa producida por procesos naturales o artificiales.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Thing</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#RequiresRecomputeIndicators">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Factor de caracterización cuyos indicadores dependientes deben recomputarse (cabeza de R25).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>RequiresRecomputeIndicators</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Product_Related_File">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#File"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Archivo relacionado con productos, p. ej. diseños CAD (Fig. 3.12).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Product_Related_File</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#EnvironmentalIndicator">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ImpactIndicator"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Aspecto medible de desempeño ambiental. Subclase de iso14040:ImpactIndicator.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">EnvironmentalIndicator</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#ProductionLine">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#Cell"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Línea de producción: agrupación de estaciones/equipos. Subclase de enterprise:Cell.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ProductionLine</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#HighImpactIndicator">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Indicador de alto impacto inferido por la regla R04.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>HighImpactIndicator</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Resource">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Entidad definida por sus comportamientos y capacidades, utilizada por los procesos productivos (ISO 10303-49, ISO 15531). Se refina en el Módulo de Recurso (ResourceMod).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Recurso</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Resource</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#QualitySpec">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Product_Information"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Especificación de calidad (viscosidad KU, finura Hegman). Subclase de product:Product_Information: describe el producto (datos verificables y requisitos).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">QualitySpec</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#BottleneckResource">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Recurso cuello de botella (referida por R22; la variante del Anexo C de R12 la poblaba — ver comentario de R22).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>BottleneckResource</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Plant">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#Factory"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Planta de fabricación. Subclase de enterprise:Factory (jerarquía de Zhao et al. 1999, Fig. 3.13).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Plant</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#CostAttribute">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Atributo de costo</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Chemical_Compound">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Substance"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Compuesto químico (resinas, aditivos, biocidas). Subclase de product:Substance: los estándares describen las sustancias como generalización de los ítems de producción (Fig. 3.8).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Chemical_Compound</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#TimeAttribute">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Atributo temporal</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#ContinuousProcess">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Artificial_Process"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Proceso continuo. Subclase de process:Artificial_Process.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ContinuousProcess</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessPlan">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Plan de proceso</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Device">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Resource"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Dispositivo de medición y control que supervisa variables del proceso (sensores, manómetros, válvulas inteligentes). Especialización directa de Resource (Fig. 3.9).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Device</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Role">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Rol que determina las capacidades específicas de una Person y sus permisos de acceso a las actividades del sistema (Fig. 3.11).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Role</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Person">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Resource"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Recurso humano dentro de la industria; especialización de Resource. Los individuos de Person se relacionan con Role para determinar sus capacidades específicas (Fig. 3.11).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Person</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Process">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Procedimiento particular para hacer algo que involucra uno o más pasos u operaciones, y que puede producir un producto, una propiedad de un producto o un aspecto de un producto (ISO 10303-49). Se refina en el Módulo de Proceso (ProcessMod).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Proceso</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Process</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Activity">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Concepto genérico de actividad usado para las relaciones Activity-Resource (Figs. 3.11 y 3.12). Process_Activity del Módulo de Proceso se corresponde con esta clase.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Activity</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#UnitProcess">
    <owl:equivalentClass rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingProcess"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Proceso unitario LCA</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#ProductionCell">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#Cell"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Célula de producción. Subclase de enterprise:Cell.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ProductionCell</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#Interpretation">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Interpretación</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#HumanResource">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingResource"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Recurso humano</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#CharacterizationFactor">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Factor de caracterización</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ImpactCategory">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Categoría de impacto</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Instruction">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Product_Information"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Característica funcional: información sobre cómo fabricar, ensamblar o utilizar el producto (p. ej., un manual de montaje o una guía de usuario).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Instruction</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#CleaningOperation">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#CleaningOperation"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Process_Activity"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Operación de limpieza entre campañas de color/familia. Subclase de process:Process_Activity y de iso15531:CleaningOperation (patrón de validación R26).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">CleaningOperation</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Sensor">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Device"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Sensor de proceso. Subclase de resource:Device (dispositivo de medición y control, §3.3.2).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Sensor</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ElementaryFlow">
    <owl:equivalentClass>
      <owl:Class>
        <owl:intersectionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
          <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingResource"/>
          <owl:Restriction>
            <owl:hasValue>
              <i:ResourceState rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment#Consumed">
                <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Estado 'consumido' de un recurso (axioma A3 del Listado 3.3).</rdfs:comment>
                <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
              </i:ResourceState>
            </owl:hasValue>
            <owl:onProperty>
              <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#resourceCurrentState"/>
            </owl:onProperty>
          </owl:Restriction>
        </owl:intersectionOf>
      </owl:Class>
    </owl:equivalentClass>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Flujo elemental</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Workshop">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#Shop"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Taller/área de producción. Subclase de enterprise:Shop.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Workshop</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#Quality_Control_Activity">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessOperation"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Actividad de control de calidad. Declarada en la capa de alineamiento para soportar el patrón de validación R19 sin alterar el conteo de 18 clases del módulo ISO 15531 (Listado 3.2).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>Quality_Control_Activity</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Behaviour">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Comportamiento que define a un Resource (ISO 10303-49).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Behaviour</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Product_Information">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Información del producto (ISO 10303-1): captura la dimensión física (Physical_Characteristics) y funcional (Instruction, Fact, Concept) de los productos.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Product_Information</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Intermediate_Product">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Product"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Producto intermedio (p. ej., pasta de pigmento). Subclase de core:Product: es un producto en un estadio intermedio del plan de proceso.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Intermediate_Product</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Resource_Related_File">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#File"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Archivo asociado a recursos específicos (Fig. 3.12).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Resource_Related_File</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#ProductBatch">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#Lot"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Lote de producto fabricado. Subclase de iso15531:Lot: el lote es el concepto MANDATE canónico de agrupación de producción.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ProductBatch</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#EnvironmentalAspect">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Aspecto ambiental</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Tool">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Resource"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Herramienta manual o consumible empleada en operaciones puntuales (p. ej., cepillos o raspadores). Especialización directa de Resource (Fig. 3.9; ISO 15531, ISO 18629).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Tool</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#QualityAttribute">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Atributo de calidad</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#Shop">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:someValuesFrom>
          <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#Factory"/>
        </owl:someValuesFrom>
        <owl:onProperty>
          <owl:TransitiveProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#isPartOf"/>
        </owl:onProperty>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Área o departamento de producción donde se coordinan múltiples células para completar una fase significativa del proceso manufacturero.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Shop</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Substance">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Thing"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Generalización de Production_Item: sustancia producida por procesos naturales o artificiales (Fig. 3.8).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Substance</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Consumable">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Material"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Material consumible auxiliar. Subclase de resource:Material.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Consumable</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingResource">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Recurso de manufactura</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#BatchProcess">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Artificial_Process"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Proceso por lotes de la fabricación de pinturas. Subclase de process:Artificial_Process (transformación industrial planificada, §3.3.2).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">BatchProcess</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProductionOrder">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Orden de producción</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Standard">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#File"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Documento normativo utilizado en manufactura. Subclase de resource:File: se gestiona como recurso documental/digital (Fig. 3.12).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Standard</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#Lot">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Lote</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#Measurement"/>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#AllocationProcedure">
    <owl:equivalentClass>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessOperation"/>
    </owl:equivalentClass>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Procedimiento de asignación</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingFacility">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Instalación de manufactura</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment#SPARQLValidationPattern">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Clase de anotación para los patrones de validación SPARQL ASK (R07, R16, R19, R26) documentados en ontologies/alignment-queries.sparql.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>SPARQLValidationPattern</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#CleaningOperation">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessOperation"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Operación de limpieza entre campañas. Declarada en la capa de alineamiento para soportar el patrón de validación R26 sin alterar el conteo de 18 clases del módulo ISO 15531 (Listado 3.2).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>CleaningOperation</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Supplier">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Enterprise"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Proveedor externo de materias primas. Subclase de core:Enterprise (organización con metas de ofrecer productos/servicios, ISO 10303-239).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Supplier</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#MissingEnvironmentalData">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Proceso con datos ambientales faltantes; se asserta a partir del resultado del patrón de validación R07 (alignment-queries.sparql).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>MissingEnvironmentalData</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Parameters">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Valores concretos de configuración (temperatura, presión, tiempo) necesarios para la correcta ejecución de actividades y procedimientos.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Parameters</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#QualityParameter">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#QualityAttribute"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Característica medible de producto o proceso. Subclase de iso15531:QualityAttribute.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">QualityParameter</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Equip">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Resource"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Equipo industrial fijo que ejecuta operaciones de transformación (molinos, reactores, dosificadores). Especialización directa de Resource (Fig. 3.9). Relevante para el caso de estudio del Capítulo 4, donde los equipos de molienda son instancias de Equip.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Equip</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Formulation">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Instruction"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Fórmula/receta de una pintura. Subclase de product:Instruction: es información funcional sobre cómo fabricar el producto (§3.3.2).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Formulation</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Physical_Characteristics">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Product_Information"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Características físicas del producto: propiedades tangibles como dimensiones, peso, forma, material o color.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Physical_Characteristics</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessOperation">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Operación o actividad atómica de manufactura. En el Anexo C las reglas la referencian también como "Activity" (p. ej., R01, R02, R11); esta clase es su representación canónica.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Operación de proceso</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Setup_Activity">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Process_Activity"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Actividad de preparación/cambio de formato. Subclase de process:Process_Activity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Setup_Activity</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#LCAStudy">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:cardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger"
        >1</owl:cardinality>
        <owl:onProperty>
          <owl:FunctionalProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#hasFunctionalUnit"/>
        </owl:onProperty>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Estudio de ACV</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingFlow">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Flujo de manufactura</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Product">
    <owl:equivalentClass>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Product"/>
    </owl:equivalentClass>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Production_Item"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Especialización de Production_Item (ISO 10303-214, ISO 10303-239). Equivalente al concepto Product del Nivel Principal, que este módulo refina (IRI usado por el axioma A1 del Listado 3.3).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Product</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#temporarilyUnavailable">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingResource"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Recurso temporalmente no disponible (cabeza de R15; IRI tal como figura en el Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>temporarilyUnavailable</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Process_Plan">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Process_Plant"/>
        <owl:onProperty>
          <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#isHeldBy"/>
        </owl:onProperty>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Conjunto ordenado de procesos requeridos para fabricar un producto.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Process_Plan</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Procedure">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Método o protocolo específico para ejecutar un proceso; se asocia con Process según ISO 10303.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Procedure</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#File">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Resource"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Archivo digital general, gestionado como un tipo particular de recurso (Fig. 3.12).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">File</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#Factory">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:someValuesFrom>
          <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Enterprise"/>
        </owl:someValuesFrom>
        <owl:onProperty>
          <owl:TransitiveProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#isPartOf"/>
        </owl:onProperty>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Instalación completa que alberga múltiples áreas de producción (shops) y cuenta con la infraestructura necesaria para la manufactura integral de productos.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Factory</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#SystemBoundary">
    <owl:equivalentClass rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingFacility"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Frontera del sistema</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Process_Material">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Material"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Material requerido para llevar a cabo una Process_Activity; vincula el Módulo de Proceso con el Módulo de Recursos (definición canónica en ResourceMod, Fig. 3.10).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Process_Material</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Production_Component">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Production_Item"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Especialización de Production_Item: componente que compone un Product y puede descomponerse en subcomponentes (ISO 10303-214, ISO 10303-239).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Production_Component</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Product">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Cosa o sustancia producida por procesos naturales o artificiales (ISO 10303, ISO 15531, ISO 15926). Se refina en el Módulo de Producto (ProductMod).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Producto</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Product</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessState">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Estado de proceso</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Process_Activity">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Paso u operación atómica dentro de un proceso.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Process_Activity</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#MaterialFlow">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingFlow"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Flujo de materiales a través de los procesos. Subclase de iso15531:ManufacturingFlow.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">MaterialFlow</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingData">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Registro de datos de manufactura; los eventos MES (regla R13, Anexo C) se representan como individuos de esta clase.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Dato de manufactura</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Manufacturing_Stage">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Process_Activity"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Etapa de fabricación (dispersión, molienda, mezcla...). Subclase de process:Process_Activity: paso u operación dentro del proceso (§3.3.2).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Manufacturing_Stage</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Enterprise">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Una o más organizaciones con un conjunto de metas y objetivos para ofrecer productos y/o servicios (ISO 10303-239). Se refina en el Módulo de Empresa (EnterpriseMod).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Empresa</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Enterprise</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Packaging">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Process_Activity"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Actividad de envasado. Subclase de process:Process_Activity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Packaging</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Material">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Resource"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Recurso material gestionado según las necesidades de cada fase del ciclo de producción (Fig. 3.10; ISO 10303-232, ISO 10303-227, ISO 10303-1082).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Material</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#FineGrindingOperation">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessOperation"/>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Fact">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Product_Information"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Característica funcional: dato objetivo y verificable sobre el producto (p. ej., "peso: 2,5 kg" o "resistencia térmica: hasta 120 °C").</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Fact</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Capability">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Capacidad que define a un Resource (ISO 10303-49).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Capability</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#Location">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Ubicación geográfica de las instalaciones empresariales; una misma localización puede albergar múltiples entidades organizacionales (parques industriales o complejos compartidos).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Location</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#EquipmentResource">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingResource"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Recurso de equipamiento</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Inspection">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#QualityControl"/>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Inspección de materiales/producto. Subclase de paint:QualityControl.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Inspection</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#WorkCell">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#Cell"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Célula de trabajo. Subclase de enterprise:Cell.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">WorkCell</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Customer">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Cliente que adquiere productos. La asociación Product-Customer se modela como relación binaria muchos-a-muchos (simplificación de ISO 10303-41; no se importan Product_relationship ni Person_organization).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Customer</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Production_Item">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Substance"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Abstracción que representa la forma general del producto (ISO 10303-1, ISO 10303-41); se especializa en Product y Production_Component.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Production_Item</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ImpactIndicator">
    <owl:equivalentClass rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#QualityAttribute"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Indicador de impacto</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Warehouse">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#Shop"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Almacén de materias primas/producto terminado. Subclase de enterprise:Shop (área funcional dentro de la fábrica).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Warehouse</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#Supplier"/>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#RatioObservation"/>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Procedure_Activity">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Process_Activity"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Instanciación o ejecución concreta de una Process_Activity; permite diferenciar entre la definición abstracta de una actividad y su realización específica.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Procedure_Activity</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#FunctionalUnit">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Unidad funcional</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingCapability">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Capacidad de manufactura</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#requiresReprocess">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#Lot"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Lote que requiere reproceso (cabeza de R18; IRI tal como figura en el Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>requiresReprocess</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Artificial_Process">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Process"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Proceso artificial (industrial), derivado de la definición de Process en los estándares ISO TC184/SC4.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Artificial_Process</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#CoverageGap">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Brecha de cobertura de mapeos puente (cabeza de R24).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>CoverageGap</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#GoalAndScopeDefinition">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Definición de objetivo y alcance</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Natural_Process">
    <owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Artificial_Process"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Process"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Proceso natural, derivado de la definición de Process en ISO 8000, ISO 10303, ISO 13584, ISO 15531, ISO 15926 e ISO 18629.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Natural_Process</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Product_Material">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Material"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Material que forma parte del producto (Fig. 3.10).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Product_Material</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Department">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#Shop"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Departamento funcional. Subclase de enterprise:Shop.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Department</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#Station">
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#Cell"/>
        <owl:onProperty>
          <owl:TransitiveProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#isPartOf"/>
        </owl:onProperty>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Estación de trabajo individual donde se ejecuta una operación o tarea específica del proceso productivo (nivel más básico de la jerarquía).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Station</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#LifeCycleInventory">
    <owl:equivalentClass rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessPlan"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Inventario de ciclo de vida</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Hotspot">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Hotspot: combinación de alto impacto ambiental y baja eficiencia (cabeza de R22).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>Hotspot</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#LifeCycleImpactAssessment">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Evaluación de impacto</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Final_Product">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Product"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Producto terminado listo para el cliente. Subclase de core:Product.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Final_Product</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#EnergyResource">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Resource"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Recurso energético consumido por las actividades. Subclase directa de core:Resource (no es Tool/Equip/Device ni Material sólido).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">EnergyResource</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#QualityControl">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#Quality_Control_Activity"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Process_Activity"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Actividad de control de calidad. Subclase de process:Process_Activity y de iso15531:Quality_Control_Activity (clase usada por el patrón de validación R19).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">QualityControl</rdfs:label>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#belongsTo">
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf>
      <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#isHeldBy"/>
    </rdfs:subPropertyOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Pertenencia de un recurso/actividad a una unidad organizacional. Subpropiedad de core:isHeldBy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>belongsTo</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#eventForProcess"/>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#hasSystemBoundary">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#SystemBoundary"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#LCAStudy"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Frontera del sistema de un estudio de ACV.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasSystemBoundary</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#employs">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Person"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Una organización emplea personas.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>employs</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#consumesMaterial">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingResource"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessOperation"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Una actividad consume un material (regla R20, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>consumesMaterial</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#emits">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ElementaryFlow"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#UnitProcess"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un proceso unitario emite flujos elementales (usada por la regla R03, Listado 3.4).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>emits</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#forOperation"/>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#requiresResource">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingResource"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessOperation"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Una operación requiere un recurso de manufactura (regla R12, Listado 3.4).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>requiresResource</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#executedByResource">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Resource"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Activity"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">El recurso ejecuta directamente la actividad (Fig. 3.11).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>executedByResource</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#canBeConsultedBy">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Role"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Activity"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Una Activity puede ser consultada por un Role; establece los permisos de acceso a las actividades del sistema y a otras entidades relevantes (relación n:n, Fig. 3.11).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>canBeConsultedBy</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#hasProcess">
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf>
      <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#involve"/>
    </rdfs:subPropertyOf>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Process"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Propiedad de conveniencia: relaciona una entidad con un proceso que contiene o realiza. Subpropiedad de involve para el caso Enterprise-Process.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasProcess</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#hasCapability">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingCapability"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingResource"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un recurso posee una capacidad de manufactura (cabeza de la regla R12, Listado 3.4).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasCapability</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#hasEmissionFactor">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#CharacterizationFactor"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Vincula una actividad/proceso con su factor de emisión, modelado como CharacterizationFactor (reglas R01 y R21, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasEmissionFactor</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#definedBy">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Product_Information"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Production_Item"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un Production_Item está definido por su Product_Information (agregación 1..n, Fig. 3.8).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>definedBy</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#hasActivity">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessOperation"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#Lot"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Trazabilidad lote a actividades/operaciones (regla R21, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasActivity</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#hasCategory">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ImpactCategory"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Categoría de impacto de un indicador ambiental.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasCategory</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#manages">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Una unidad organizacional o persona gestiona otra entidad.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>manages</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#computedForProcess">
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ImpactIndicator"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Indicador de impacto calculado para un proceso (patrón de validación R07, alignment-queries.sparql).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>computedForProcess</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#composes">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Product"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Production_Component"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un Production_Component compone un Product (relación n:n, Fig. 3.8).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>composes</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#partOfOrganization">
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf>
      <owl:TransitiveProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#isPartOf"/>
    </rdfs:subPropertyOf>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Una unidad organizacional es parte de otra. Subpropiedad de enterprise:isPartOf.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>partOfOrganization</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#includesActivity">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessOperation"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessPlan"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un plan de proceso incluye operaciones/actividades (regla R09, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>includesActivity</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#hasImpact">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Asocia un proceso o lote con un impacto/indicador de impacto (regla R05, Anexo C: agregación de impactos por etapa hacia el lote).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasImpact</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#refersToMaterial">
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ElementaryFlow"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un flujo de inventario refiere a un material concreto (reglas R06 y R20, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>refersToMaterial</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#usesResource">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Resource"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Activity"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">La actividad utiliza el recurso sin consumirlo (Fig. 3.11).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>usesResource</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#hasCapability">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Capability"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Resource"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un Resource se define por sus capacidades (ISO 10303-49).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasCapability</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#locatedAt">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/enterprise#Location"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Relaciona Enterprise (y sus instalaciones) con Location para especificar la ubicación geográfica.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>locatedAt</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#hasBehaviour">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Behaviour"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Resource"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un Resource se define por sus comportamientos (ISO 10303-49).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasBehaviour</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#responsibleOperator">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#HumanResource"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessOperation"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Operador responsable de una actividad, para trazabilidad (cabeza de la regla R14, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>responsibleOperator</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#appliesTo">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un impacto o aspecto ambiental aplica a un componente o proceso (ejemplo ilustrativo §3.3.3.4).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>appliesTo</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#employedBy">
    <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#employs"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Inversa de employs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>employedBy</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#producedBy">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Process"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Product"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un Product es producido por un Process (Fig. 3.6).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>producedBy</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#hasGHGContribution"/>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#hasProcessPlan">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Vincula un producto con el proceso/plan que lo fabrica.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasProcessPlan</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#hasProcess">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingProcess"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#Lot"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un lote se asocia a los procesos por los que transita (regla R05, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasProcess</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#hasPlan"/>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#hasResource">
    <owl:inverseOf>
      <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#usedBy"/>
    </owl:inverseOf>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Resource"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Propiedad de conveniencia: un Process dispone de un Resource. Inversa de usedBy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasResource</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#precedesEvent">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingData"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingData"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Secuencia temporal entre eventos MES (cabeza de la regla R13, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>precedesEvent</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#producesProduct"/>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#partOfProcess">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingProcess"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessOperation"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Una operación es parte de un proceso de manufactura (regla R02, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>partOfProcess</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#belongsToProcess"/>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#precedes">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Process"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Process"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Orden entre procesos: un Process precede a otro Process en el plan de proceso.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>precedes</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#isComposedOF">
    <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#composes"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Production_Component"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Product"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un Product puede estar compuesto por múltiples Production_Components (ISO 10303-214, ISO 10303-239). Inversa de composes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>isComposedOF</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#requiresCleaningBetween">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#Lot"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#Lot"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Se requiere limpieza entre dos lotes de familias incompatibles procesados en el mismo equipo (cabeza de la regla R17, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>requiresCleaningBetween</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#hasStageResource"/>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#usedBy">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Process"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Resource"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un Resource es usado por un Process (Fig. 3.6).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>usedBy</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#assignsResource">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingResource"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessPlan"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un plan de proceso asigna recursos (regla R09, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>assignsResource</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#executesActivity">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessOperation"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#WorkOrder"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Una orden de trabajo (ejecución de actividad) ejecuta una operación (regla R14, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>executesActivity</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#acquiredBy">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Customer"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/product#Product"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un producto puede ser adquirido por múltiples clientes y un cliente puede adquirir varios productos (relación n:n).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>acquiredBy</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#hasWaterFootprint">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ImpactIndicator"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Indicador de huella hídrica asociado a un producto.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasWaterFootprint</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#suppliesTo">
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#Supplier"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un proveedor suministra a una organización.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>suppliesTo</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#hasCarbonFootprint">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ImpactIndicator"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Indicador de huella de carbono asociado a un producto (individuo de iso14040:ImpactIndicator).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasCarbonFootprint</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#hasFormulation"/>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#isHeldBy">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Vincula una entidad (típicamente un Resource) con la Enterprise o instalación que la posee o alberga (Figs. 3.6 y 3.7).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>isHeldBy</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#forIndicator"/>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#hasMaintenance">
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingResource"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un recurso tiene mantenimiento programado (regla R15, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasMaintenance</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#cleanedResource"/>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#producesResource">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Resource"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Activity"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">La actividad genera o modifica el recurso como resultado (Fig. 3.11).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>producesResource</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#forLot"/>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#processedOn">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#EquipmentResource"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#Lot"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un lote se procesa sobre un equipo (regla R17, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>processedOn</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#hasSkill">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingCapability"/>
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#hasCapability"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Habilidad de un recurso humano, modelada como capacidad de manufactura. Subpropiedad de iso15531:hasCapability.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasSkill</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#hasMeasurement"/>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#produces">
    <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#producedBy"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Product"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Process"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Inversa de producedBy: un Process produce un Product.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>produces</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#hasRole">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Role"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Person"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Una Person se relaciona con Role para determinar sus capacidades específicas (agregación 1..n, Fig. 3.11).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasRole</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#hasMeasurement">
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#Quality_Control_Activity"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Medición asociada a una actividad de control de calidad (patrón de validación R19). Declarada en la capa de alineamiento para no alterar el módulo ISO 15531.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasMeasurement</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#hasNonConformity">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#QualityAttribute"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#Lot"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un lote presenta una no conformidad de calidad (regla R18, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasNonConformity</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#executedBy">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingResource"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#WorkOrder"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Una WorkOrder es ejecutada por al menos un recurso (restricción del Listado 3.2; también usada por R14 para el operador responsable).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>executedBy</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#nextLot"/>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#consumesResource">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Resource"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Activity"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">La actividad consume el recurso durante su ejecución (Fig. 3.11).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>consumesResource</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#precedes">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Precedencia entre lotes u operaciones en la campaña de producción (reglas R17 y patrón R26).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>precedes</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment#hasEmittedFlow">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ElementaryFlow"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#Lot"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Flujo emitido asociado a un lote (cabeza de R03, Listado 3.4).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasEmittedFlow</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#hasCertification">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Certificación de un recurso humano.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasCertification</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#specifiedBy">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Procedure"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Process"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un Process está especificado por un Procedure (Fig. 3.7).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>specifiedBy</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#hasParameter">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Parameters"/>
    <rdfs:domain>
      <owl:Class>
        <owl:unionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
          <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Procedure"/>
          <owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Procedure_Activity"/>
        </owl:unionOf>
      </owl:Class>
    </rdfs:domain>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Procedure y Procedure_Activity están vinculados a Parameters (agregación, Fig. 3.7).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasParameter</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#resourceCurrentState">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ResourceState"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingResource"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Estado actual de un recurso (usada por el axioma A3 del Listado 3.3: ElementaryFlow equivale a ManufacturingResource en estado Consumed).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>resourceCurrentState</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#composedBy">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/process#Process_Activity"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Process"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un Process está compuesto por sus Process_Activities (agregación 1..n, Fig. 3.7).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>composedBy</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#bridgesFlowToActivity">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessOperation"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ElementaryFlow"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Puente entre un flujo de inventario ISO 14040 y una actividad ISO 15531 (cabeza de R20).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>bridgesFlowToActivity</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#usesCharacterizationFactor">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#CharacterizationFactor"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ElementaryFlow"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un flujo de inventario usa un factor de caracterización (cabeza de la regla R06, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>usesCharacterizationFactor</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#hasShelfLife">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Especificación de vida útil asociada a un producto.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasShelfLife</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#isOutputOfActivity">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Activity"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#File"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un File es salida de una Activity (Fig. 3.12).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>isOutputOfActivity</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#isInputToActivity">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Activity"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#File"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Un File es entrada de una Activity (Fig. 3.12; se adopta isInputToActivity según el texto del capítulo).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>isInputToActivity</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#hasInput">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingResource"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessOperation"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Entrada material de una actividad (patrón de validación R16, alignment-queries.sparql).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasInput</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#hasInventoryFlow">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ElementaryFlow"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Asocia un proceso con un flujo de inventario (regla R02, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasInventoryFlow</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#requiresResource">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Resource"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#Activity"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">La actividad requiere el recurso pero no necesariamente lo ejecuta (Fig. 3.11).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>requiresResource</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#planProduces"/>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#involve">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Process"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#Enterprise"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Una Enterprise involucra (planifica y ejecuta) procesos productivos (Fig. 3.6; ISO 15531, ISO 18629 vinculan Process con Enterprise).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>involve</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#producesLot">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#Lot"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#WorkOrder"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Una WorkOrder produce un Lot (reglas R03 y R23, Listado 3.4).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>producesLot</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#providedBy"/>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#usesResource">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ManufacturingResource"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#ProcessOperation"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Una actividad usa un recurso (cabeza de la regla R09, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>usesResource</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#hasCharacterizationFactor">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#CharacterizationFactor"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Asocia un material con su factor de caracterización (regla R06, Anexo C).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasCharacterizationFactor</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#hasVOCContent">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ImpactIndicator"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Indicador de contenido de VOC asociado a un producto.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>hasVOCContent</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#skillCode">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#HumanResource"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Código de habilidad de un recurso humano (instancias del caso de estudio, Cap. 4).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>skillCode</rdfs:label>
  </owl:DatatypeProperty>
